{
  "assessment": "As Prime Minister of Ukraine during wartime, our primary existential objective is national survival and the eventual liberation of our occupied territories (Donets'k, Luhans'k, Crimea, Sevastopol). Despite maintaining high military spending, domestic discontent across all strata requires careful management to prevent internal fracture without undermining our war effort. We must secure our alliances, particularly in the West, and maintain macroeconomic stability while countering Russian aggression.",
